{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006. The 2005 ending reserve of $4 million rose to $10 million at December 31, 2006, explained by $4 million of 2006 pretax warranty charges plus $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in 2006 acquisitions less $5 million of cash outlays.","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","result_id":"tool:1","sources":["source:q11n0","source:q11n1","source:q11n2","source:q12n3","source:q13n0","source:q14n0"]}}